y age group (0–5 years and 6–12 years).\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Significance was defined as p<0.05.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Calls reporting co-exposures to other agents were excluded to minimize confounding effects.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}